t also the gov. hackers probably figured out the existence of Garou from schreknet or books info looted from kindred Cainite hidey holes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Time will tell regarding Zettler's chances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T02:32:04-07:00","id":1246581,"title":"","content":"In regards of the defense of the Tremere themselves.<br /> It all assume that the operation to take down the Vienna chantry, which is if am not mistaken pretty much in the middle of the city, would be executed at night. Attacking vampires at night would be a quite massively stupid idea, thus I would assume that the SI ran its false flag operation, that yes included massive collateral damage, during the light of day. From like brunch to dinner, sweeping up at night only what couldn't be handled during the day.<br /> <br /> Well, and with all the thaumaturgic defense mechanism, it is unlikely that a chantry has &quot;Warding against missle strikes&quot; or &quot;Warding against humans&quot;, the latter might exist, yet would be kind of problematic with the placement at the core of Vienna.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7336-teylen","name":"Teylen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7336_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T05:43:49-07:00","id":1246613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1237168-gentleman-s-guide-to-vampires-v5?p=1243480#post1243480\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Time will tell regarding Zettler's chances.</div> </div> </div> </div>*snort* if somehow any of them actually managed to get at the Pentex board - and that's hugely unlikely - if Anyone/thing were to survive it would be an elder malk. There's nothing like deny to ruin someone's day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24538-sardonic","name":"Sardonic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T06:09:45-07:00","id":1246624,"title":"","content":"I really like the videos so far can't for more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24536-troy70","name":"troy70","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24536_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T08:04:29-07:00","id":1246654,"title":"","content":"I'm in agreement with troy70. I'm hoping for, in the future, an episode for each clan (REALLY want to hear what's going on with the Clan of Death, the Ravnos and the Tsimizce), and maybe an episode on the Kindred take on other World of Darkness gameline types.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T02:36:56-07:00","id":1246928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1237168-gentleman-s-guide-to-vampires-v5?p=1246654#post1246654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm in agreement with troy70. I'm hoping for, in the future, an episode for each clan (REALLY want to hear what's going on with the Clan of Death, the Ravnos and the